    .string "error"
.L17875:
    .string "function"
.L17876:
    .string "(error \"message\")"
.L17877:
    .string "Return `(Err message)`. Does not raise: handle it by matching. From core/result. To unwind to the nearest try/catch instead, use `panic`."
